      "block_id": "2605.00155_p3_b0",
      "text": "Figure 1: Reward over-optimization in RLHF, adapted from Gao et al. [2023]. The\nhorizontal axis measures how far policy optimization has moved from the initial policy,\nwhile the vertical axis reports reward-model evaluation. When the policy is optimized\nagainst the proxy reward model, the proxy evaluation keeps increasing, but the gold\nreward model\u2019s evaluation first improves and then deteriorates.\n",
      "bbox": [
        71.58,
