    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p3_b1",
      "text": "RLHF [Moskovitz et al., 2024], or behavior- and demonstration-supported regularization\n[Dai et al., 2025, Rita et al., 2024, Liu et al., 2024]. These safeguards can be useful, but\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        395.39,
        523.67,
