      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p3_b4",
      "text": "[Coste et al., 2024, Eisenstein et al., 2024], iterative or active preference collection [Xiong\net al., 2024, Das et al., 2024], alternative reward-model objectives [Miao et al., 2024], or\n",
